  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.09 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Chiropractic Examiners",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.09 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Chiropractic Examiners. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.9, below, shall apply to the profession regulated by the board of chiropractic examiners under RSA 316-A:\n\nTable 1002.9 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Chiropractic Examiners\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nChiropractor license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, reinstatement after expiration of license, or return to active status | 2 years | $330\n\nSource. #13703, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
